						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">The CD strat listed is very close to SoEs &#039;vision&#039;.&nbsp; We read that strat, ours was basically exactly the same.. still took us 5(?) runs to get it down?<br /><br />Like you said DA/EiE made a couple adjustments (as any guild will) and it literally clicked.&nbsp; It was almost flawless.</td>
